                                                "sense_id": "29f29398-3c6e-3483-91b9-5dddd0061d1a",
                                                "text": "She had a very fresh complexion and a pretty, round little face saved from any dolliness by the steadiness of her blue eyes, the firmness of her mouth, and the expression of quiet self-possession."
